WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.923
Now our focus is going to be on the human skeletal system.

00:00:03.223 --> 00:00:06.506
This system includes bones and also connective tissue like: (1)

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.875
ligaments - generally connecting bone to bone, (2) tendons – which

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:13.394
generally connect muscle to bone – and also (3) cartilage which we’ll

00:00:13.394 --> 00:00:13.798
get to later.
